    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo. 25 Kingsbridge arrives to the market in good decorative condition throughout. This two-bedroom apartment is located in Kingsbridge complex, an extremely private, fully enclosed residential area of just thirty-four homes.\n\nEntering the apartment you are presented with an entrance hall, open and spacious kitchen/dining room, three-piece suite bathroom and two spacious double bedrooms. \n\nExternally there is an enclosed patio to the rear of the property along with a communal garden which runs through the complex. No. 25 also benefits from a designated parking space.\n\nKingsbridge is in a great location and is within easy reach of a host of amenities including good schools both primary and secondary. It is also within close proximity to Douglas Village and Cork City Centre and is on a very good bus route. The South Ring Road network is very accessible as it sits directly across from the complex. \n\nViewing is essential to fully appreciate all that this lovely home has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.28m x 1.5m\nBright and welcoming entrance hall with tiled flooring.\n\nLiving/Dining Area - 5.48m x 5.58m\nThis is an open and spacious room to the front of the property with laminate wood flooring and large French doors that allow natural into the room.\n\nKitchen - 2.50m x 2.43m\nThe kitchen is spacious and well-equipped with both floor and eye-level units. It features tiled flooring, a tiled splash back, integrated kitchen appliances and an open plan design connected with the living and dining areas.\n\nBathroom - 1.74m x 2.03m\nThis three-piece bath suite is fully tiled and features a shower over the bath.\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.68m x 3.45m\nSpacious double bedroom with built-in wardrobes, laminate wooden flooring and overlooks the patio to the rear of the property.\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.69m x 3.97m\nLocated to the rear of the property this spacious double bedroom features laminate wood flooring built-in wardrobes. Access to the rear patio is provided from here.\n\n"
      },
      {
